BACKGROUND MUSIC:
Happy kids friendly cartoon background music starts immediately with the video.
Playful, upbeat and funny mood.
Light comedy style music.
Soft cheerful instruments like xylophone, ukulele, bells and light drums.
Music should loop smoothly across the entire video.
Consistent low volume so voices are always clear.
No cinematic or dramatic music.
No sad or dark tone.
No heavy bass.
Keep the music bright, joyful and fun from start to end.
